# SHACL-Shape-Driven Projection Vocabulary

Generated by `shacl-projection-pack` -- a static reference doc for the shared vocabulary a
projection-target pack (e.g. `shacl-to-pydantic-pack`, or `packs/dspy-pack`'s own
SHACL-shape-driven Signature derivation) reuses by IRI.

## Predicates

- `sp:derivedFromShape` -- links a projected artifact to the real `sh:NodeShape` supplying its
  fields.
- `sp:isPrimaryOutput` -- marks an `sh:PropertyShape` as a real, rendered field of the target
  artifact, never a fabricated default.

## Admitted `sh:datatype` values

`xsd:string`, `xsd:boolean`, `xsd:integer`, `xsd:long`, `xsd:decimal`, `xsd:float`,
`xsd:double` -- enforced by `gates/010_shape_validity.rq`.
